%% Mermaid state diagram: Candidate Deliverable lifecycle v1
%%{init: {"state": {"htmlLabels": false}}}%%
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> PROCESSING : assemble draft
  PROCESSING --> FAILED : system error / dependency
  FAILED --> PROCESSING : retry / regenerate
  PROCESSING --> PENDING_JUDGMENT : submit to Guardian
  PENDING_JUDGMENT --> QUARANTINED : Guardian BLOCK
  QUARANTINED --> PROCESSING : remediation
  QUARANTINED --> OPERATOR_PREP : waiver approval
  PENDING_JUDGMENT --> OPERATOR_PREP : PASS/WARN
  OPERATOR_PREP --> APPROVAL_REQUESTED : operator submits
  APPROVAL_REQUESTED --> QUEUED_FOR_REVIEW : queue assignment
  QUEUED_FOR_REVIEW --> CHANGES_REQUESTED : reviewer REJECT
  CHANGES_REQUESTED --> OPERATOR_PREP : operator revises
  QUEUED_FOR_REVIEW --> APPROVED : reviewer APPROVE
  APPROVED --> SIGNED : signing (digital seal)
  SIGNED --> RELEASED : portal release
  RELEASED --> REVOKED : replacement / compliance action
  REVOKED --> PROCESSING : superseded version regeneration
  RELEASED --> [*]

  note right of RELEASED
    DL class enters status RELEASED;
    overview diagram shows retention gate and
    subsequent archive/delete decisions.
    Retention/erasure gate applies from any state.
  end note
